    quotes: ["I always say that you could publish my trading rules in the newspaper and no one would follow them.", "Trading is a little bit like hitting a ball. If you're thinking what your bat angle should be, you'll never hit it.", "I learned to avoid trying to catch up or double up to recoup losses."],
